From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] Shell: native picker touch scrolling, rounded clipping and owned discovery

Keep nearby actors and discovery active while the native picker is open.
Use a one-finger native PanGesture, a shared pixel-radius actor mask and
symmetric overlay scrollbar spacing. Preserve pairing and radio ownership.
Keep the notification-owned generated suffix byte-for-byte last.

